<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-023-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.152369" lon="-120.795637"><name>SC26-023-B</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.8 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 59/100; not catch probability. Center 83 ft; nearby 81–100 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-004</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.15515224806934" lon="-120.79748301296063"/><trkpt lat="35.15445135417362" lon="-120.79859957388847"/><trkpt lat="35.153203836265114" lon="-120.79940154520456"/><trkpt lat="35.153107749717876" lon="-120.79907484032474"/><trkpt lat="35.15274732804536" lon="-120.79908455095632"/><trkpt lat="35.152753309078875" lon="-120.79941368170937"/><trkpt lat="35.15167204368005" lon="-120.7994428082221"/><trkpt lat="35.151754174519624" lon="-120.79900154540333"/><trkpt lat="35.151483858220345" lon="-120.79900882827067"/><trkpt lat="35.15139973381755" lon="-120.79934038115765"/><trkpt lat="35.150212412036666" lon="-120.79849427962425"/><trkpt lat="35.15005612472443" lon="-120.79981561506384"/><trkpt lat="35.14962153799974" lon="-120.80070539679865"/><trkpt lat="35.14926908364765" lon="-120.8011539217769"/><trkpt lat="35.14890666943706" lon="-120.8010539166308"/><trkpt lat="35.14891463606381" lon="-120.80149273761747"/><trkpt lat="35.1479334297959" lon="-120.80206792781131"/><trkpt lat="35.14640163313091" lon